  "rationale": "The plant models robot motion and perception as a single automaton, capturing all sensor and actuation events. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: always prefer forward/random_walk in clear, use rotate_clockwise for left obstacles, rotate_counterclockwise for right, and move_backward for front obstacles. Recovery is conservative and brief, returning to exploration as soon as path_clear is observed. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state, and only one controllable is enabled per state.",
